[{"title":"池上看金沙花数枝过酴醾架盛开二首 其一","author":"王安石","text":"午阴宽占一方苔，映水前年坐看栽。\n红蕊似嫌尘染污，青条飞上别枝开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12885,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池雁","author":"王安石","text":"羽毛摧落向人愁，当食哀鸣似有求。\n万里衡阳冬欲暖，失身元为稻粱谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12886,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹窗","author":"王安石","text":"竹窗红苋两三根，山色遥供水际门。\n只我近知墙下路，能将屐齿记苔痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12887,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"王安石","text":"春半花才发，多应不奈寒。\n北人初未识，浑作杏花看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12888,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红梨","author":"王安石","text":"红梨无叶庇花身，黄菊分香委路尘。\n岁晚苍官才自保，日高青女尚横陈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12889,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老嫌","author":"王安石","text":"老嫌智巧累形躯，欲就田翁学破除。\n百岁用痴能几许，救吾黥劓可无馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12890,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自定林过西庵","author":"王安石","text":"午鸡声不到禅林，柏子烟中静拥衾。\n忽忆西岩道人语，杖藜乘兴得幽寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12891,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟过长芦","author":"王安石","text":"木落草摇洲渚昏，泊船深闭雨中门。\n回灯只欲寻归梦，儿女纷纷强笑言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12892,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观明州图","author":"王安石","text":"明州城郭画中传，尚记西亭一舣船。\n投老心情非复昔，当时山水故依然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12893,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访隐者","author":"王安石","text":"童子穿云晚未归，谁收松下著残棋。\n先生醉卧落花里，春去人间总不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12894,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达本","author":"王安石","text":"未能达本且归根，真照无知岂待言。\n枯木岩前犹失路，那堪春入武陵原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12895,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过外弟饮","author":"王安石","text":"一自君家把酒杯，六年波浪与尘埃。\n不知乌石冈边路，至老相寻得几回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12896,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过刘全美所居","author":"王安石","text":"西崦晴天得强扶，出林知有故人居。\n数能过我论奇字，当复令公见异书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12897,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过法云寺","author":"王安石","text":"路过潮沟八九盘，招提雪脊隐云端。\n金钿一一花总老，翠被重重山更寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12898,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过徐城","author":"王安石","text":"七年五过徐城县，自笑皇皇此世间。\n安得身如仓庾氏，一官能到子孙闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12899,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过皖口","author":"王安石","text":"皖城西去百重山，陈迹今埋杳霭间。\n白发行藏空自感，春风江水照衰颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12900,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"两生","author":"王安石","text":"两生才器亦超群，黑白何劳强自分。\n好与骑奴同一处，此时俱事卫将军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12901,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丽泽门","author":"王安石","text":"丽泽门西日未俄，水明沙净卷纤罗。\n绿琼洲渚青瑶嶂，付与诗工敢琢磨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12902,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伯牙","author":"王安石","text":"千载朱弦无此悲，欲弹孤绝鬼神疑。\n故人舍我闭黄壤，流水高山心自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12903,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初到金陵","author":"王安石","text":"江湖归不及花时，空绕扶疏绿玉枝。\n夜直去年看蓓蕾，昼眠今日对纷披。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12904,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夏即事","author":"王安石","text":"石梁茅屋有弯埼，流水溅溅度两陂。\n晴日暖风生麦气，绿阴幽草胜花时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12905,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初晴","author":"王安石","text":"幅巾慵整露苍华，度陇深寻一径斜。\n小雨初晴好天气，晚花残照野人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12906,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别方劭秘校","author":"王安石","text":"迢迢建业水，中有武昌鱼。\n别后应相忆，能忘数寄书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12907,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别皖口","author":"王安石","text":"浮烟漠漠细沙平，飞雨溅溅嫩水生。\n异日不知来照影，更添华发几千茎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12908,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别鄞女","author":"王安石","text":"行年三十已衰翁，满眼忧伤祇自攻。\n今夜扁舟来诀汝，死生从此各西东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12909,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别灊阁","author":"王安石","text":"一溪清泻百山重，风物能留邴曼容。\n后夜肯思幽兴极，月明孤影伴寒松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12910,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事二首 其二","author":"王安石","text":"云从无心来，还向无心去。\n无心无处寻，莫觅无心处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12911,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事二首 其一","author":"王安石","text":"云从钟山起，却入钟山去。\n借问山中人，云今在何处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12912,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其五","author":"王安石","text":"春光冉冉归何处，细雨斜风作夜寒。\n犹有数葩红好处，老年花似雾中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12913,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其四","author":"王安石","text":"遮莫邻鸡下五更，愿为闲客此闲行。\n欲知前面花多少，颠倒青苔落绛英。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12914,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其三","author":"王安石","text":"幽栖地僻经过少，钟梵声中掩竹门。\n唯有多情枝上雪，暗香浮动月黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12915,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其二","author":"王安石","text":"一树笼松玉刻成，游蜂多思正经营。\n攀枝弄雪时回顾，还绕樱桃树下行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12916,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事五首 其一","author":"王安石","text":"渐老逢春能几回，蓬门今始为君开。\n莫嫌野外无供给，更向花前把一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12917,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即席","author":"王安石","text":"曲沼融融泮尽澌，暖烟笼瓦碧参差。\n人情共恨春犹浅，不问寒梅有几枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12918,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县舍西亭二首 其二","author":"王安石","text":"主人将去菊初栽，落尽黄花去却回。\n到得明年官又满，不知谁见此花开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12919,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县舍西亭二首 其一","author":"王安石","text":"山根移竹水边栽，已见新篁破嫩苔。\n可惜主人官便满，无因长向此徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12920,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听泉亭","author":"王安石","text":"逗石穿云落涧隈，无风自到枕边来。\n十年客底黄粱梦，一夜水声却唤回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12921,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴任道说应举时事","author":"王安石","text":"县瓠城南陂水深，春泥满眼路岖嵚。\n独骑瘦马冲残雨，前伴茫茫不可寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c0685